        },
        "content": "<div style=\"font:13px/1.6 Inter,Roboto,sans-serif;color:#9aa2ad;padding:2px 4px 0 4px\"><b style=\"color:#d8dde3\">Host-HCA InfiniBand boards</b> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#6e9fd8\" href=\"/d/nvis-ib-cable-audit\">Rail State &amp; Cabling</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#6e9fd8\" href=\"/d/nvis-ib-blast-radius\">Blast Radius</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#6e9fd8\" href=\"/d/nvis-ib-flaps\">Link Flaps</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#6e9fd8\" href=\"/d/nvis-ib-drops\">Port Errors</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#6e9fd8\" href=\"/d/nvis-ib-congestion\">Congestion &amp; Throughput</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#6e9fd8\" href=\"/d/nvis-ib-signal\">Signal Quality</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#6e9fd8\" href=\"/d/nvis-ib-offenders\">Worst Offenders</a><br><span style=\"color:#7c848e\">Source: <code>ib_hca_*</code> counters read on every DGX tray by node-exporter, four rails per tray. Every number on the left of a band is backed by the table beside it, built from the identical selector \u2014 the table footer prints the row count.</span></div>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
